  data: {
    LLM: 'Two players; deal alternates. Each player gets 26 cards: 9 face down on table (5+4 rows), 9 face up on top, 8 in hand. Non-dealer leads. Each trick is two cards; play from hand or face-up layout; when a layout card is played the card beneath is turned face up. Must follow suit if possible. No trumps. Higher card of led suit wins; trick winner leads next. Player with more tricks wins.',
    Player: 'Two players; deal alternates. Each player gets 26 cards: 9 face down on table (5+4 rows), 9 face up on top, 8 in hand. Non-dealer leads. Each trick is two cards; play from hand or face-up layout; when a layout card is played the card beneath is turned face up. Must follow suit if possible. No trumps. Higher card of led suit wins; trick winner leads next. Player with more tricks wins.',
    objective: 'The objective is to win more tricks than the opponent. There are 26 tricks in total; the player who wins the majority wins the game. There is no point scoring.',
